Description: Make building against givaro optional again.
 Beginning in version 1.9, building against givaro became required.  But M2
 needs a patched version of givaro containing a function not found in the
 Debian package.
Origin: reversion of https://github.com/d-torrance/M2/commit/714a1b0d1d707780d3543ac97304c49cd51a62a1
Last-Update: 2016-07-15

